lines.t:
A human who owns a <c:ffff00>{{medawatch}}<c> and manages
<c:ffff00>{{medabot|pl}}<c>. On rare occasions there are {{medafighter|pl}}
who aren't human.

During a <c:ffff00>{{robattle}}<c>, they give orders to {{medabot|pl}}
through the {{medawatch}}. Their own {{medabot|pl}} also
call them {{master}}.
